      "text": "AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE MAYOR AND COMMISSIONER OF\nFINANCE OF THE CITY OF NEW YORK, RELATING TO THE ESTABLISHMENT\nOF AN OFFICE OF PAYROLL ADMINISTRATION",
