        232,
        1372,
        1404,
        1469
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "IT IS FURTHER AGREED that this Agreement and the Order\nimplementing this Agreement shall remain in full force and effect so long as\nthe parties continue to consent to this Agreement.",
